Whoa, whoa, whoa!

287
00:13:55,251 --> 00:13:57,836
-  Now, <i>princesa.
- Great.</i>

288
00:13:57,837 --> 00:13:59,129
Let's get you up.

289
00:13:59,130 --> 00:14:00,964
What the fluff!

290
00:14:00,965 --> 00:14:02,799
Did my pumpkins go rogue again?

291
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,135
Let's get out of here. Come on.

292
00:14:04,635 --> 00:14:05,720
Is that a no?

293
