Okay. We should find my mom.
She'll help us.

295
00:14:10,808 --> 00:14:12,100
<i>Absolutely not.</i>

296
00:14:12,101 --> 00:14:13,226
Go to Wonderland?

297
00:14:13,227 --> 00:14:14,644
Without Auradon guards?

298
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,480
Without the other kingdoms' help?

299
00:14:16,481 --> 00:14:19,232
There are rules, Chloe.
Protocols to follow.

300
00:14:19,233 --> 00:14:21,693
But when it's important,
rules don't matter.

301
00:14:21,694 --> 00:14:24,154
We just have to get in there
and get our hands dirty.

302
00:14:24,155 --> 00:14:25,406
Right, Mom?

303
00:14:25,948 --> 00:14:28,116
Girls,
you can't just bibbidi-bop yourselves

304
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:29,826
into a dangerous villain's hands.

305
00:14:29,827 --> 00:14:31,328
No, ma'ams.

306
00:14:31,329 --> 00:14:33,789
Maddox is not to be trifled with.

307
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:37,584
He's terrorized the kingdoms for years
with his deranged inventions.

308
00:14:37,585 --> 00:14:40,462
<i>Your mother had him banished
to the Isle of the Lost.</i>

309
00:14:40,463 --> 00:14:41,797
<i>He's a madman.</i>

310
00:14:41,798 --> 00:14:42,882
In your time.

311
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:47,427
Now, I spoke with Uma,
and she's calling the Auradon Council,

312
